      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Approximately 20% of the Mo content should be replaced by Nb, changing NbZrTiHfMo to Nb1.2ZrTiHfMo0.8.",
